                "text": "Good health doesn\u2019t come from a syringe; it comes from nutrition, sanitation, good water, and having access to medical treatment. WHO used to focus on that work, but now it and a slew of NGOs make momentous public health-related decisions that facilitate the agenda of the pharmaceutical industry and intrude on American sovereignty. When I\u2019m president, I\u2019ll put an end to that. #Kennedy24",
